<h1>Patterns</h1><p class="c-lead">Combine components to help people complete a task and understand the result.</p><p>Start with <a href="../home-assistant/index.html">Home Assistant controls and flows</a> for native device, state and household-task specifications. Browse the catalogue below for shared patterns and page compositions.</p><p>Each reference has usage guidance, contextual examples, accessibility checks and an explicit Home Assistant implementation boundary. A reference example does not mean the native Home Assistant interface has been replaced.</p><p>See the <a href="../community/coverage.html">source coverage record</a> for the complete NHS and publishing-guide mapping.</p><%= partial 'partials/catalogue', locals: { section: 'patterns' } %>
